  },
  {
   "id": "plt-redex",
   "relation": "family"
  },
  {
   "id": "ott",
   "relation": "family"
  }
 ],
 "level_notes": {
  "1": "No standard: the K User Manual documents the language; its logical foundation is matching logic (Roșu). Early K was implemented on top of Maude.",
  "0": "runtimeverification/k (Java/Scala frontend, LLVM and Haskell backends); the builtin modules (domains.md) are K's standard library."
 },
